Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:42.00,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,その声聞いてオカルトオーディオでもいいから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.91,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,イチケニで魂叫べ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:48.93,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,たとえ君が単騎でも　ロマンスくれたら
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:50.56,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,サンキトウセン
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDTW-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:42.00,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,聽聲音玩耳機玄學也無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.91,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,用192kHz吶喊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:48.93,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,最算你是單騎　有浪漫也就無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:50.56,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,三騎當千
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------INJP-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:43.08,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}問い
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:47.49,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}涙の果て
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:54.07,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}今　朝陽が登って行く
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:57.14,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}気つついた
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.58,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}歌を乗せて
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:06.25,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}風は流れて行く
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:09.41,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}そして
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.40,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}僕らは帰る
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:20.03,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}いつか確かに居た場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:26.95,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}心焦がした　夢今はも
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:33.56,akiba-opjp,,0,0,0,,{\an7}追いかけていますか
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------INTW-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:43.08,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,提問
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:47.49,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,流淚過後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:54.07,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,現在 朝陽正攀升而起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:57.14,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,當回過神來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.58,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,已乘著歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:06.25,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,順風而行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:09.41,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,然後
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.40,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,我們便會歸來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:20.03,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,最終會回到那個熟悉的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:26.95,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,心情焦急 現在還會對那個夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:33.56,akiba-optw,,0,0,0,,繼續追逐下去嗎
